#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create observable to go with the new circuit {#create-observable-to-go-with-"
"the-new-circuit}"
msgstr ""
"Gumawa ng observable na sasama sa bagong circuit {#create-observable-to-go-"
"with-the-new-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This observable corresponds with `observable`, but we must account correctly"
" for the extra qubit wire that has been added (i.e., we insert an \"I\" at "
"index 4).  Note that in Qiskit, the string representation qubit-0 "
"corresponds to the right-most Pauli character.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang observable na ito ay tumutugma sa `observable`, ngunit dapat nating "
"wastong isaalang-alang ang dagdag na qubit wire na naidagdag (i.e., "
"naglalagay tayo ng \"I\" sa index 4). Tandaan na sa Qiskit, ang string "
"representation ng qubit-0 ay tumutugma sa pinakakanang Pauli character.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Separate the circuit and observables {#separate-the-circuit-and-observables}"
msgstr ""
"Paghiwalayin ang circuit at observables {#separate-the-circuit-and-"
"observables}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As in the previous tutorials, qubits sharing a common partition label will "
"be grouped together, and non-local gates spanning more than one partition "
"will be cut.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tulad sa nakaraang mga tutorial, ang mga qubit na naghahati ng karaniwang "
"partition label ay pagsasama-samahin, at ang mga non-local gate na "
"sumasaklaw sa higit sa isang partition ay puputulin.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the decomposed problem {#visualize-the-decomposed-problem}"
msgstr ""
