#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Calculate the sampling overhead for the chosen cuts {#calculate-the-"
"sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"
msgstr ""
"Kalkulahin ang sampling overhead para sa napiling mga cut {#calculate-the-"
"sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Here we cut two wires, resulting in a sampling overhead of $4^4$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dito, pinuputol natin ang dalawang wire, na nagreresulta sa sampling "
"overhead na $4^4$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more on the sampling overhead incurred by circuit cutting, refer to the "
"[explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa higit pa tungkol sa sampling overhead na nakukuha mula sa circuit "
"cutting, sumangguni sa [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate the subexperiments to run on the backend {#generate-the-"
"subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr ""
"Bumuo ng mga subexperiment na patatakbuhin sa backend {#generate-the-"
"subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`generate_cutting_experiments` accepts `circuits`/`observables` args as "
"dictionaries mapping qubit partition labels to the respective "
"`subcircuit`/`subobservables`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang `generate_cutting_experiments` ay tumatanggap ng "
"`circuits`/`observables` args bilang mga dictionary na nagma-map sa qubit "
"partition labels patungo sa mga kaukulang `subcircuit`/`subobservables`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To simulate the expectation value of the full-sized circuit, many "
"subexperiments are generated from the decomposed gates' joint "
"quasiprobability distribution and then executed on one or more backends. The"
" number of samples taken from the distribution is controlled by "
"`num_samples`, and one combined coefficient is given for each unique sample."
" For more information on how the coefficients are calculated, refer to the "
"[explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr ""
"Upang i-simulate ang expectation value ng full-sized na circuit, maraming "
"subexperiment ang nabubuo mula sa joint quasiprobability distribution ng mga"
" decomposed na gate at pagkatapos ay isinasagawa sa isa o higit pang "
"backend. Ang bilang ng mga sample na kinukuha mula sa distribution ay "
"kinokontrol ng `num_samples`, at isang combined coefficient ang ibinibigay "
"para sa bawat unique sample. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon kung paano "
"kinakalkula ang mga coefficient, sumangguni sa [explanatory "
"material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

